---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service - Online Resume ATS" description="Terms of service for Online Resume ATS free resume tools.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-20">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-500 mb-8">Last updated: June 2026</p>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-600 space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>By using Online Resume ATS, you agree to these terms of service. If you do not agree, please do not use our tools.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">2. Service Description</h2>
      <p>Online Resume ATS provides free, browser-based resume optimization tools including ATS score checking, cover letter generation, domain conversion, and keyword analysis. All processing occurs locally in your browser.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">3. No Guarantee of Results</h2>
      <p>While our tools provide guidance and suggestions for improving your resume's ATS compatibility, we cannot guarantee that any specific resume will pass any particular ATS system or result in job interviews. Our scoring is rule-based and approximates common ATS behavior.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">4. User Responsibilities</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>You are responsible for the accuracy of the information in your resume.</li>
        <li>You should review and customize any generated content (such as cover letters) before using them.</li>
        <li>Do not use our tools to create misleading or fraudulent application materials.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">5. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>The content you provide (resume text, job descriptions) remains yours. Any content generated by our tools (cover letters, suggestions) is provided for your personal use in job applications.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">6. Availability</h2>
      <p>We strive to keep our tools available 24/7 but cannot guarantee uninterrupted service. We may update, modify, or temporarily disable features for maintenance.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>Online Resume ATS is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We are not liable for any damages arising from the use of our tools, including but not limited to lost job opportunities or inaccurate scoring.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">8. Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms at any time. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">9. Contact</h2>
      <p>For questions about these terms, please visit our <a href="/contact" class="text-primary-600 hover:underline">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
